          "tests/Incursa.Quic.Tests/Http3ExtendedConnectTests.cs::HeaderValidator_MalformedExtendedConnect_ThrowsMessageError"
        ]
      },
      "notes": [
        "Trimmed to the testable invariant while preserving the RFC8441 dependency."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "REQ-QUIC-RFC9220-0002",
      "title": "Set SETTINGS_ENABLE_CONNECT_PROTOCOL to 0x08",
