          "tests/Incursa.Quic.Tests/Http3WebSocketMessageReaderTests.cs::ServerReader_RejectsUnmaskedClientFrame"
        ]
      },
      "notes": [
        "Masking enforcement is endpoint-role dependent; this requirement covers the server receiving client bytes."
      ]
    },
